        "text_FDmm8T": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Nick Norwitz is a researcher and science educator whose mission is to make metabolic health mainstream. He graduated valedictorian from Dartmouth, earned his PhD in metabolism from Oxford, and completed his MD at Harvard. His YouTube channel reaches over 1.2 million subscribers, and his newsletter, Stay Curious Metabolism, has ranked among the top science publications on Substack. </p><p>Metabolic health, and the food choices behind it, are his life's work.</p><p><em>\"I eat fish literally every day. So quality matters. Seatopia is setting a new standard for nutrient-rich, pollutant-free, and ethical seafood.\" </em>—<em> </em>Nick Norwitz, MD PhD</p><p>Get $20 off first-time Seatopia orders of  $125+ with code 'STAYCURIOUS'.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
